<InnerLayout title="Why Your AI Coding Agent's Output Won't Run in Production | Nixora Resources" description="Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex generate working applications: but 'working' and 'production-ready' aren't the same thing. Here's the specific gap and how to close it." jsonLd={[articleSchema, breadcrumbSchema]}>

  <article style="padding:4rem 2rem 5rem;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.5rem;">
    
    <!-- Article Header -->
